{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7f475ea22b57133f450ccac5a04f33f3f9c0294e91035406a5249cdc30582d2d","ja":"雪女を探して","zh":"寻找雪女","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f5eb86f52df20bf8db441a6c653025d54ef43fcda2bb2f60d1e34b2b953bd02e","ja":"美奈子たち4人は、バラエティー番組の撮影で、\nとある高原に来ていて……","zh":"美奈子等4人正在某个高原拍摄综艺节目……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"45d97808d26988147036d26adc5a922a27427acdf037861f308057706567c221","ja":"なんと私たちは今、『雪女』を探しにきています！\nでも本当に、こんなところにいるんでしょうか？","zh":"没想到我们现在竟然来寻找“雪女”了！\n不过，她真的会在这种地方吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9cd57195ac292448acb66857dd753f4512686c18fdad133ccbe83e4eeba136a8","ja":"こ、ここって……観光地の近く……ですよね。\n雪山でもないのに、も、目撃されたんですか……？","zh":"这、这里是……观光地附近……对吧。\n明明不是雪山，却、却被目击到了吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3096c3369500b719cb07f7aeff9ec8de3d9790c5a36b7e200ee6c4464e83f3e0","ja":"「はい。最近、話題になってるそうで。番組にも、\n絶対に探してほしいと、お便りが多数きてるんです」","zh":"“是的。听说最近成了热门话题。节目也收到了很多来信，拜托我们一定要找到它。”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6bd8f894907e4167bc30e5e566c08b0400ed94c12fe49afc39a3a9eee87f51bc","ja":"多数、ですか！？\nじゃ、じゃあ、本当にいるのかも……？","zh":"很多吗！？\n那、那说不定真的有……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"64679c31127d683e67d8d761f2ffdec707c7f7de632dd084194ea36f1f3b46ea","ja":"そ、それなら……\nみ、見つけてあげたいですね……。","zh":"那、那样的话……\n我、我想帮忙找找看……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"786ea0f54bf53ee59d922f5bd933077124fcf0cdcf2b9e7a7c68317a0943a101","ja":"私も、いるならぜひ、お会いしてみたいです。\n……わくわく。","zh":"如果也在的话，我也很想见见。\n……好期待。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4daad18645056fe9f0289b8e375e01df4600847ef522f3916c78de7f2f512d0d","ja":"あれっ？　でも雪女って、\n真冬に出てくるイメージがあるヨ？","zh":"咦？可是雪女给人的印象，不是会在隆冬时节出现吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0734001c354eacc63df69f5638f24200643533ec2f15e68c517f1765024e06ee","ja":"確かに……吹雪の中にたたずんでいる姿が、\n思い浮かびます。","zh":"确实……能想象出伫立在暴风雪中的身影。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"dc01592837f4f0fed5caab97383a2ede43c0eaf660ade41702d0c80bcbdbc381","ja":"そうだよネ？　今は涼しいくらいだけど……\n雪女って、寒くなくても平気なのかナ？","zh":"没错吧？现在也就凉快而已……\n雪女就算不冷也没关系吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"297b5c4d2008bbbea8b2c0e0156927fc5e88e24889c10e7e88accf334b7e8dda","ja":"それじゃあ……いたとしても、\nあ、暑くて、倒れちゃってるかも……。","zh":"那么……就算在的话，\n啊，说不定也因为太热而晕倒了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1810.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"842cb478be2352eeee78bc4add5f4827479412a75b9cb617ba01b2674de4c1af","ja":"う～ん……それなら、早く見つけてあげた方が\nいい……のかな？　とにかく、調査開始します！","zh":"嗯……既然这样，还是早点帮忙找到比较好……吧？总之，开始调查！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
